{"id":"en_bad-eyes-sweet-lies","title":"Bad Eyes, Sweet Lies","titleEn":"Bad Eyes, Sweet Lies","description":"A country girl is pushed into a marriage meant for her cousin, becoming the bride of Ronan Ashford, a feared and powerful CEO. Though people describe him as merciless and almost sightless, she alone uncovers a gentle side he keeps hidden. Once his vision is restored, a malicious plot drives the couple apart. Everything changes when a pregnancy test draws the wife he believed he had lost back into his life.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/aff7e207c007e7bb/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/aff7e207c007e7bb/zh_TW/9782818ad3d5a28e/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Comeback","Hidden Identity","CEO","Romance","Clapback","Love-Torture"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5egm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_bad-eyes-sweet-lies_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5egm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bad-eyes-sweet-lies_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5egm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bad-eyes-sweet-lies_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5egm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bad-eyes-sweet-lies_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d5egm/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bad-eyes-sweet-lies_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","lab